    "title_en": "One-loop unifying relations between Yang-Mills theory and the nonlinear sigma model from Berends-Giele currents",
    "abstract_en": "We study unifying relations between Yang-Mills theory and the nonlinear sigma model. We extend tree-level amplitude relations expressed through differential operators to off-shell multiparticle currents and obtain one-loop integrand relations by sewing two off-shell legs. This off-shell approach may also apply to higher-loop integrands.",
